<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10180"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Nancydrew<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Nancydrew<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 02, 2005 - 1:17 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hi Steve...We don&#39;t know each other....unless.... <BR> <BR>Grow up in the &#39;burbs, by any chance?  <BR> <BR>Patti Lupone kicks Angela Lansbury&#39;s behind, by the way.   <BR> <BR>Hasn&#39;t &#34;Dogcatcher&#34; been here since the arrest?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
