<!--Post: 10192--><!--Time: 1109804478-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10192"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Chiquitah<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Chiquitah<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 02, 2005 - 3:01 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I can&#39;t resist this one: <BR> <BR>STEVE:  See? You ARE a STUD!  Maybe you can sing for us at the next &#34;official&#34; party? U DA MAN! 4 kids.......a busy man, too! <BR> <BR>LOSTDOG: Let me remind you its your fault we all feel like crap. Thanks for the leg cramps from dancing all night on that table. You were MAHVOULOUS!! <BR>Hairy and somewhat smelly.........YOU&#39;RE THE KING! YOU&#39;RE THE KING!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
