</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Topsailgrl<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 3:49 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Steve-Can I have your autograph??? Congrats on the article! I havent seen the sketch, where is it posted?  <BR> <BR>By the way, my daughter <b>Stevie</b> is also a singer. She is just a kid in high school right now but has been singing in choirs all over the state since 3rd grade. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
